NAME
     gktool – utility for assessing Gatekeeper policy on applications

SYNOPSIS
     gktool scan path
     gktool help scan



DESCRIPTION
     gktool is used assessing Gatekeeper policy on applications. This is
     useful for pre-warming the cache so users do not see the 'Verifying...'
     dialog on first launch of an application.


     gktool requires exactly one subcommand option to determine what action is
     to be performed.


SUBCOMMANDS
     The subcommands are as follows:

     scan    Performs a Gatekeeper scan of the specified path.


     help    Print help for the particular subcommand.


SEE ALSO
     codesign(1), spctl(8), stapler(1), syspolicy_check(1)

